---
title: Fingerling Potatoes (CSO)
servings: 4
tags: CSO, AI
source.author: AI Cooking Agent
course: Side dish
prep time: 5 minutes
cook time: 30 minutes
difficulty: Easy
---

> This uses steam-enhanced convection to cook faster and retain moisture before crisping.

Place a wire rack in the second lowest position of the #convection steam oven{}.
Preheat in convection steam mode at 375°F.

In a large bowl, add @fingerling potatoes{1%lb}(halved).
Toss with @sea salt{}, @black pepper{}, and @olive oil{} to coat.

Cook the potatoes for ~{20-30%min} or until fork-tender.

Optionally crisp the potatoes in a cast iron pan over high heat if you want an additional crunch.

Transfer to a bowl to serve.
